# Archive

This directory contains background, research, external references, superseded designs, and process material that remains useful for historical understanding.

Archive content is non-authoritative. Current project truth remains in the canonical sources listed by `artifact_index.md`.

Organize material by purpose or source, use stable descriptive names, and retain provenance when known. Do not move active canonical sources here without explicit approval.

Ordinary discovery and cold start must not recursively read this directory. Read archived material only when a task explicitly requires historical or background context.
